1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,057
Now race three chains.

2
00:00:02,057 --> 00:00:07,578
Make the springs four times stiffer, and the push races along twice as fast.

3
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:12,968
Make the masses four times heavier as well, and it slows back down to where it started.

4
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:17,330
Speed goes as the square root of stiffness over inertia.

